<section class="about-us">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <p class="slogan"></p>
        
        <p class="lead content-with-html"><p>Founded in 1999 by Aron Cohen and Jonny Kaye, the PI Group has spent over two decades identifying and capitalizing on high-value opportunities across various sectors and asset classes, both in Israel and globally.</p></p><p class="lead content-with-html"><p>PI's journey began when Aron and Jonny recognized significant pricing inefficiencies in Israel's early listed derivatives market. By 2001, PI had grown into one of the country's largest proprietary derivative trading firms.</p></p>        
        <!-- Image Slider -->
        <div class="about-image-slider">
            <div class="about-image-slider__container">
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/01.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/02.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_2898.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_2932.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_2936.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_2937.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_2980.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_3004.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_3159 BW.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_3441.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                                <div class="about-image-slider__slide" style="background-image: url('assets/images/about_us/IMG_3521.webp'); background-position: center center;"></div>
                            </div>
            <div class="about-image-slider__controls">
                <button class="about-image-slider__button about-image-slider__button--prev" aria-label="Previous image">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                </button>
                <div class="about-image-slider__dots"></div>
                <button class="about-image-slider__button about-image-slider__button--next" aria-label="Next image">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <p class="lead content-with-html"><p>While proprietary trading and investing have always been at PI's core, PI gradually expanded into other areas of the Israeli financial market. In 2003, working closely with the Israeli SEC, PI issued Israel's first ETF, the Hadas (dollar-linked tradable commitment). The Hadas ETF grew significantly in popularity, eventually managing assets worth 3.5 billion ILS. Two years later, in 2005, PI launched the Shacharit, Israel's first listed structured product.  In total, during the following couple of years PI issued 4 billion ILS worth of products.</p></p><p class="lead content-with-html"><p>PI also played a pioneering role in Israel's hedge fund industry. In 2004, PI established Arbitrade, the country's first hedge fund, followed by PI EMF, a global macro derivatives fund, in 2005. PI EMF maintained a flawless track record, generating positive returns every year throughout its 16-year lifespan.</p></p><p class="lead content-with-html"><p>In 2021, Kesem, the mutual fund arm of the Phoenix Investment house, invested and partnered with PI to create PI Crypto, a boutique investment house specializing in the Crypto and blockchain space.</p></p><p class="lead content-with-html"><p>More recently, in 2023, PI co-founded PI PItuach, a firm specializing in financial product structuring and securitization capitalizing.  In 2024, PI PItuach, capitalizing on both the growing demand for short-term fixed-income investments and inefficiencies in local market regulations issued over 7.5 billion ILS in bonds primarily bought by Israeli money market funds.</p></p><p class="lead content-with-html"><p>As we continue to evolve, PI Group remains committed to identifying market inefficiencies and creating innovative financial solutions. Our experienced team and proven track record position us uniquely in the financial landscape.</p></p>        
        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="company-history">
                            </div>
        </div>

        
        
